### Musician session (Jorge, profile 1) - JWT for the calls below
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/session/wallet
Content-Type: application/json

{ "walletPubkey": "YmTYQJifjP2DawdxDUYuNCZJ5to9ge5nNGaWGW2ozJU" }

> {% client.global.set("musician", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Non-musician login (jwt.gate has no musician profile)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jwt.gate@eh8s.local",
  "password": "eh8s-dev-pass1"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Pins without Bearer must be 401
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/stage-map/pins

### Pins for a month: purple partner > yellow upcoming confirmed show > green open dates > red
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/stage-map/pins?month=2026-10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bad month format is 400
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/stage-map/pins?month=october
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Publish an open date for Foro Disponible (venue 2, no venue wallet) - 409 if already open
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/stage-map/venues/2/availability
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "availableDate": "2026-10-16" }

### Pin popup for venue 2 (capacity, contract type, genres, rating, available days)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/stage-map/venues/2?month=2026-10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Jorge plays in two bands, so bandId is required (400 without it)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/stage-map/venues/2/slot-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{musician}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "showDate": "2026-10-16" }

### Request slot for band 1 on an open date - booking status requested (409 on repeat)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/stage-map/venues/2/slot-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{musician}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "showDate": "2026-10-16", "bandId": 1 }

### A date that is not open is 409
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/stage-map/venues/2/slot-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{musician}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "showDate": "2026-10-17", "bandId": 1 }

### An account without a musician profile is 403
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/stage-map/venues/2/slot-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "showDate": "2026-10-16", "bandId": 1 }
